            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. A teacher may re-enroll in the health insurance program defined in Section A above, without restrictions. Re-enrollment shall be subject to the normal waiting period for new teachers unless unusual circumstances arise which would result in the teacher having no group health insurance coverage.",
            "block_bbox": [
