        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "10. When the current health insurance benefit program is to be rebid, the Association shall have an opportunity to review the specifications prior to its being released for bid. The Fringe Benefits Committee shall participate in the development of specifications prior to submission and review of the bids prior to the time of award.",
